# Portable LAN server: runtime data only. app/server.cjs and the launcher scripts are real
# source and should be tracked; everything under app/data/ is live exam data (candidate
# answers, examiner scores, the operator token) generated on whoever's machine runs the
# server, and app/dist/ is a build artifact (npm run build -> copy into app/dist).
app/data/
app/dist/
Archive.zip

# Private key / certificate material must never be committed, wherever it turns up (found real
# ones in app/certs-disabled/ during this cleanup, not just the expected app/certs/).
*.pem
*.key

# Vite dev-server mock/local API storage (testPackageAdminPlugin, fieldPreparationPlugin) —
# fake data for local `npm run dev` testing only, never real exam data.
.vetbara-local/

# Claude Code local tool config (preview server launch settings) — machine-specific.
.claude/
.env*

# Supabase CLI temp
supabase/.temp/
